    right:["That one sat. Bear approves.","Woof. Correct, and Bear did not even stand up.","Bear thumps once. That is high praise.","The bot blinked. You did not.","Bear files that under: nice fetch.","A quiet yes from the black-and-tan corner.","Bear saw the answer coming. He stayed seated anyway.","Points for you. Bear pretends he is not proud.","That was clean. Bear's tail moved. Slightly.","Bear notes the bot is still thinking. You are not.","Solid sniff. Bear will allow a treat thought.","You fetched it. Bear remains professionally unimpressed, which means he is impressed.","Bear's ears did the little yes.","The rival guessed with enthusiasm. You guessed with the right word.","Bear would clap, but his paws are busy looking casual.","Correct. Bear updates the score and goes back to staring."],
