    start:["Bear is here. The bot is also here. Bear has notes.","Welcome to the show. Bear will be judging quietly.","Clues are up. Bear is down. On the rug.","The rival brought confidence. Bear brought a stare.","Pick a square. Bear will watch the bot watch you.","Lights are warm. Bear is warmer. Slightly.","Bear opens the show by sitting. It is a choice.","Your move. The bot can wait its turn.","Bear and the board are ready. The bot is practicing its buzz.","A new round. Bear's face says: we can do this without drama."],
    end:["Show's over. Bear is already halfway to a nap.","Final score is in. Bear nods like a referee.","Good game. Bear will remember the tiles you meant.","The bot can replay it in its head. Bear will replay dinner.","That is a wrap. Bear's tail signs off.","You showed up. Bear stayed. That is the whole review.","Board cleared. Bear rates the night: cozy.","Thanks for playing. Bear is off duty and still nearby."]
